    "text": "In the circuit given below, the charge in $\\mu \\mathrm{C},$ on the capacitor having $5 \\mu \\mathrm{F}$ is\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/O33zcfEW8hFj-ynlLZAV1V0aMC-qTMsxK-IC-6pbWLM.original.fullsize.png\">",
